  <description>
    <p>Zyfun is a free, minimalist, all-in-one cross-platform audio and video manager that manages all types of T1-T4 resources in one place, and has built-in multi-core players to switch at will. Exclusive boss key, one-click stealth and loaf on the job without worries. Discover the world through watching movies!</p>
    <p xml:lang="zh-Hans">Zyfun是一款免费、极简、全能的跨平台影音管家，一站式管理 T1-T4 全类型资源，内置多核播放器随心切换。独家老板键，一键隐身摸鱼无忧。用观影发现世界！</p>
